            "review_title": "Review at Quan Ba Tam",
            "review_text": "KHlau\nHong Kong, China29 contributions\n0\nSuper tasty and fresh seafood but low price!\nJun 2019 • Couples\nI love three kind of things here!\n\n1) you can find the best and fresh seafood here. You can pick up what you like and cook immediately! It is super tasty.\n2) very cheap! Crab, shrimp, fish, eggs, octopus, shell and more. It is around USD35 only for two persons\n3) many local family here. Good atmosphere. And the staff will explain the price and cookery seriously. No tourist trap!\n\n我喜歡這裡的三種東西！\n\n 1）你可以在這裡找到最好的新鮮海鮮。 你可以拿起你喜歡的東西，立即做飯！ 它非常好吃。\n 2）很便宜！ 螃蟹，蝦，魚，蛋，章魚，貝殼等。 兩人只需35美元左右\n 3）這裡有許多當地家庭。 良好的氛圍。 工作人員將認真解釋價格和烹飪。 沒有旅遊陷阱！\nRead more\nWritten August 9, 2019",
